  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You take your familiarity with a particular dance to an unhealthy level.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dance Focus</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws against dance abilities from the subtype you select. This bonus stacks with the bonus from Dance Focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Greater Dance Focus multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new subtype to which you already have applied the Dance Focus feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/primordial-dancer-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
